  "content": "```html\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">（我的第一个模组/数据包）</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_a926bc6e-7202-4d5d-b3ec-ad14554db92e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"361\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>史诗武士、史诗骑士、地牢武器、生于混沌、简易剑以及其他模组武器与史诗战斗、奇迹武器、史诗战斗战斗风格和其他附加组件的兼容性。</strong></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>还有更多！为EFM兼容性新增的轨迹纹理！<br></strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">预期兼容</span></span></span>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">以及完整体验所需的必要依赖</span>）：</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/881/915/638312712562327674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗</a> by maninthe_home/yesman</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/884/152/638318074504658168.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇迹武器</a> (wom) by reascer</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/915/178/638372918905326451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗战斗风格</a> (ef-bs) by Forixaim</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/862/853/638271674802985984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗 - 关刀动作集</a> (falchionmoveset) by namelesslk</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请检查附加文件以下载资源包以修复并添加新纹理。</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>（这将是我在找到如何将纹理包内置到数据包之前获取纹理包的方式）</strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_20d558b2-164b-4554-937a-789442eeaa53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"384\"></strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">推荐：</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/963/317/638461000018381994.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗 x 铁匠法术护甲修复</a>&nbsp;by cacheing</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此数据包/模组是为史诗战斗与各种模组兼容而制作的。根据我的个人喜好更改武器的动作集，欢迎根据您的喜好进行修改。</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>尝试您自己的战斗风格：</strong></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">如何为史诗战斗制作自定义武器和护甲的数据包：</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f%2523onetwo-handed-weapon-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://epicfight-docs.readthedocs.io/Guides/page2/#onetwo-handed-weapon-file</a></h4><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">武器来源：</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/778/486/638122554849559119.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">生于混沌</a> by mongoose_artist</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/805/606/638172713304550451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗武士</a> by VeroxUniverse</h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/411/944/637630777607986862.png\" alt=\"史诗骑士\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>/magistuarmory by magistu_</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/789/196/638143347801778495.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢武器</a> by thespringaling</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/611/576/637996129346404798.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">-简易剑</a> by sweenuss</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火：龙</a>&nbsp;by sbom_xela</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/893/638416517376113534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC地牢武器</a> by chronos_sacaria</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/892/693/638335183690820532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士附加</a> by magistu_</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/464/755/637744772991786976.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae</a> by Obscuria</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/897/696/638342973699298752.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">传说</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器</a> by DaddyUnion</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫之乐</a> by verctorwing</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/871/265/638288661913483053.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁匠法术与法术书</a> by Iron431</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/460/870/637739722679428303.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender的灾难</a> by mcl_ender</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/506/233/637824423557821613.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\">圣物重生</a> by P3pp3rF1y</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/258/931/637209858883035931.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼 - 成为吸血鬼！</a> by maxanier and Cheaterpaul</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/566/189/637924794889476652.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave的药剂学</a> by SoterDave</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a>by TheAetherTeam</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/883/158/638315999771583464.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">基础武器</a> by Khazoda</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/838/790/638231371029924457.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物魔法</a> by Elenterius</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/241/891/637131079632015619.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/796/600/638156948581632807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Weaponry</a> by Icy0x1</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/555/994/637900334510568136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">-RPG 风格 </a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 武器！</a> by zrikon</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/614/129/637997268560849585.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">简单武器，提升战斗体验</a><em> &lt;s&gt;(现支持 Epic Fight!)&lt;/s&gt;&nbsp;</em>by InfernalEclipse</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a> by Benimatic</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/280/925/637283672869883111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下花园</a> by Quek04</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/679/638025764121686580.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus the End</a> by praizazdd7724 (仅支持 1.8)</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/887/654/638325263575103332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEEAB's Mobs</a> by EEEAB</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>未来还会有更多！...</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">其他兼容性：</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/825/222/638210773187460598.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民招募</a> by talhanation</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/896/228/638341222431292689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">游戏遗迹延续</a> (仅修改了轨迹) by power282</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">数据包由 <strong>ElC4</strong> 制作，Йохан Петрович 贡献，基于其他数据包，例如：</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-simplyswords with epicfight by sunwoolove777</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-epic-knights-EFM from (epic knights discord server)</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">问答</h1><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你能添加这个模组 [插入任何武器模组] 吗？</strong></h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>我注意到了评论区中建议的模组，一旦我有时间处理这个模组，我会测试这些模组，看看它们与 Epic Fight 的兼容性如何。一些模组，如 Weapons Masters，拥有自己的战斗机制，强行使其与 Epic Fight 兼容可能会导致混乱。这就是为什么需要先进行测试。</em></h5><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">这是我第一次制作数据包/模组，意味着我跳进了一个巨大的池子，却不知道如何正确游泳。我对 Java 了解不多，仍然不明白它与 Minecraft 模组是如何工作的，但我正在学习。此外，我还是一名学生，可能会忙于一些事情，大部分空闲时间我都在玩其他游戏，希望你能理解。</p>\n<p>另外，如果我有拼写错误，请见谅，英语不是我的母语。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
